  <p class="note"><span data-conref="Tag_note.hts"> </span> This function writes to disk. To prevent data loss in case of system failure or power loss, see: <a data-xref="{text}" href="../../Additional_Information/The_File_System.htm#h2">Preventing Data Loss</a></p>
